# ATM-System

## ATM System in Python** – A command-line banking application that allows users to deposit, withdraw, transfer funds, and check account balances through an interactive menu.

Built to practice core Python concepts such as functions, loops, conditionals, user input handling, and `match-case` statements.
 Deposit funds into an account
Withdraw funds from an account
Check current account balance
Transfer funds to another account
Input validation for transactions
Menu-driven interface using Python's match-case statement
Continuous operation until the user chooses to exit

